{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Curse you... You... goatish... insufferable... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>peasant</font_kind>!": "",
  "Let's get going, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Oh, sure!": "",
  "Ahahahaha! Did you enjoy seeing me toy with him until I crushed him underfoot like the vermin he is?": "",
  "Now, my resplendent little asteroid. Let us depart this place.": "",
  "...B-But...": "",
  "Are you truly so concerned about the man?": "",
  "W-Well, yes...": "",
  "Hmph. It seems I underestimated this scruffy peasant.": "",
  "A beautiful yet tiny moon needs a planet for protection. For stability.": "",
  "It would seem we are fated to fight for such an honor.": "",
  "What are you trying to say?": "",
  "A final duel! A proper one this time! The victor will claim the right to Tsukino-san's affections!": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Another</font_kind> duel? How many times does that make this now?": "",
  "Ah, but in 19th-century England, dueling was a privilege bestowed on gentlemen to decide what the law could not!": "",
  "...You know we're not in 19th-century England, right?": "",
  "Are we not, though? You see, I carry the great country of England within my heart and soul. As such, I am always there!": "",
  "That makes no sense whatsoever...": "",
  "Besides, duels are prohibited in Japan. Are you trying to get a prison sentence?": "",
  "...A life without Tsukino-san is my only prison.": "",
  "And even if I had to reach through prison bars in order to grasp at my lover's soft hand...": "",
  "I, Daichi Ryuzenji, would gladly accept my embondagement!": "",
  "(...Is \"embondagement\" even a word?)": "",
  "If you manage to best me this time, I shall cease my pursuit of Tsukino-san once and for all.": "",
  "I swear it on my honor as a gentleman!": "",
  "Will you really stop bothering us if I win?": "",
  "As I said I would. But if you lose, I expect you to wave farewell to Tsukino-san. For all eternity.": "",
  "Now come hither, samurai boy! Show me what the land of the rising sun can do!": "",
  "So you admit your defeat? Excellent. Then hand Tsukino-san over to me!": "",
  "...Man. You are one persistent guy, you know that?": "",
  "Fine. I accept your terms.": "",
  "Sure. I've got what it takes to bring you down.": "",
  "Are you sure about this?": "",
  "Hey. Whatever it takes to get rid of this dude, I'm doing it.": "",
  "Ah, now that's more like it.": "",
  "Now then, let us relocate ourselves. It would not do for a gentleman to cause a scene in public.": "",
  "Here we are, peasant. Don't tell me you plan on fighting with fists alone?": "",
  "Eh. I'm used to it by now.": "",
  "Very well. According to tradition, I will wield the cane I inherited from my grandfather. Do you object?": "",
  "Nope, go right ahead. Use whatever you think will help.": "",
  "Hmph, I intend to. Now then...": "",
  "King Arthur! Grant me your strength! Hraaaaaaaaaaaagh!!!": "",
  "Hoargh... Impossible... A modern prince like me, losing to a pauper like you...": "",
  "You sure talk a lot about class for someone who just got schooled.": "",
  "Young Master!": "",
  "Now make good on the oath you swore and part ways with the fair maid— Ugh, now I'm starting to sound like you...": "",
  "Forgive me, my sweet Tsukino-san... I've... I've failed you...": "",
  "You little pissant. Do you have any idea how badly you messed up just now!?": "",
  "Wow. What the actual hell?": "",
  "Did you really believe you could walk away unharmed after raising a hand to the Ryuzenji Group!?": "",
  "All right, gents! Carve him up good!": "",
  "Cease this at once, Yukikawa!": "",
  "I-I beg your pardon?": "",
  "Please. Do not shame us any further. An English gentleman never backs down on his word.": "",
  "B-But... Young Master...": "",
  "Ryuzenji...": "",
  "Tsukino-san. There is something I must ask you.": "",
  "Why do you refuse my proposal? Is it that you... dislike me?": "",
  "Th-That's not it...": "",
  "Then please. Help me understand.": "",
  "I've been pining for you for so long, you see... All I wish to do is hear your heart.": "",
  "Well, I certainly don't hate you, Ryuzenji-san. In fact, I think you're actually a pretty decent guy.": "",
  "Then... why do you refuse me?": "",
  "It's... because...": "",
  "I want to stay in Tokyo and draw as a living. So I can't go home.": "",
  "Your career?": "",
  "Yes. I've been drawing ever since I was little. Right now it's still just a hobby, but I love it nonetheless.": "",
  "Is... that so...": "",
  "It is. And the only reason I haven't pursued it further is because I didn't think I'd make it as a professional.": "",
  "However... nothing good will happen if all I do is sit around and mope. I have to go all in.": "",
  "I learned that from someone special to me.": "",
  "That's why I'm gonna dive right into my career... and make my dreams come true!": "",
  "Tsukino-chan...": "",
  "I... think I understand.": "",
  "Ahahaha! Indeed! It all makes sense now!": "",
  "...What does?": "",
  "Do you remember what you drew for me, back when we were children?": "",
  "I... drew something for you?": "",
  "Oh yes. It was a picture of us... betrothed in holy matrimony. Your wedding gown was breathtaking...": "",
  "What you created was probably beyond your comprehension at the time, but it nearly moved me to tears. ": "",
  "That picture was the reason I fell in love with you.": "",
  "I-It was?": "",
  "Yes. From that day forward, my singular goal in life was to make that a reality.": "",
  "That was why I studied abroad in England... to become a gentleman worthy of your affections.": "",
  "You went that far... for me?": "",
  "But of course. In fact, I still have that picture framed on my bedroom wall.": "",
  "Alas... How ironic it is...": "",
  "That the portrait of bliss that brought us together... ended up depicting our demise.": "",
  "Ahahaha...": "",
  "Ryuzenji. No one has the right to decide someone's destiny.": "",
  "If you plan on getting in her way, then as her friend, I'm gonna have to stop you.": "",
  "...Hmph. You needn't worry.": "",
  "As her fiancé, I would never wish to hinder her in any way. I shall return home for the time being.": "",
  "And besides, I'm living proof...": "",
  "That Tsukino-san's art possesses the power to move people's hearts. Enough to change a man's life.": "",
  "That's why I want to see your drawings when you're done. Consider me your first fan.": "",
  "Ryuzenji-san...": "",
  "But if it turns out you had no intention of giving it your all...": "",
  "I'll be back to marry you faster than you can say, \"Old King Cole was a merry old soul and a merry old soul was he\"!": "",
  "A-All right then.": "",
  "Very well. I shall negotiate with your parents while you focus on your career. And so we part ways here.": "",
  "Farewell, my shining image of perfection! Let us be off, Yukikawa!": "",
  "I guess you really need to get that job now.": "",
  "You still have time until your interview. Would you like to sit down somewhere and relax for a bit?": "",
  "That sounds like a good idea...": "",
  "So... ready for that interview?": "",
  "I hope so... I'm still kinda nervous, to be honest.": "",
  "Well, what kind of company is it?": "",
  "It's a web design company. It's not really that big, but...": "",
  "I like all the websites they've designed so far. Their design philosophy seems to match my own.": "",
  "Have you got your introduction down yet?": "",
  "Yes. I've thought about my reason for applying...": "",
  "Would you mind listening?": "",
  "Not at all. I'll pretend I'm interviewing you, and you respond as naturally as you can.": "",
  "Got it. Okay, here goes!": "",
  "So, I applied here because I want to make something that moves people's hearts.": "",
  "And since your company is known for designs that are both innovative and user-friendly...": "",
  "I'd be honored to be a part of that creative culture as one of your employees.": "",
  "...Or something like that.": "",
  "Oh. Sorry. I wasn't mentally prepared.": "",
  "Hey... don't tell me <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you're</font_kind> the one who's nervous!": "",
  "Haha. Maybe so. I'll let you know when I'm ready.": "",
  "Okay. Ready when you are.": "",
  "U-Um, well...": "",
  "To be honest... I still have a lot to learn. It'll take some time for me to make any significant contributions.": "",
  "But I'd like to start by contributing whatever I can, no matter how small that may be, and learn along the way.": "",
  "That's because I'm the kind of person who gets the job done, no matter what it is.": "",
  "And as long as I have the opportunity, I believe I can be a great asset to the company.": "",
  "For example...": "",
  "This might seem a bit dramatic, but...": "",
  "I believe a well-thought-out design can influence a person's thoughts and behavior.": "",
  "That's what makes this position unique. Because if you really think about it, designers have the power to change the world!": "",
  "(I see...)": "",
  "So. What did you think?": "",
  "I think you're all set. You communicated yourself very clearly the whole time.": "",
  "I-I did?": "",
  "Yep. Though you came across as idealistic, you showed enough humility and strength of character to actually back it up.": "",
  "If it were up to me, I'd hire you on the spot.": "",
  "That's... perfect! Exactly what I was going for!": "",
  "Maybe you can bring up something more concrete when you talk about making a contribution?": "",
  "What... exactly do you mean?": "",
  "For instance, what specific tasks can you perform in an office environment?": "",
  "Well... I thought about it as hard as I could, but nothing really came to mind.": "",
  "I guess that's pretty normal. I mean, you haven't even started working yet.": "",
  "Yeah. I wouldn't want to say something that's really off and give them a bad impression.": "",
  "Right. But all in all, I do have to say...": "",
  "You sound like a completely different person than last time. In a good way.": "",
  "Well, you've given me plenty of food for thought.": "",
  "And it turns out I have a lot more going for me than I initially expected.": "",
  "Thanks to you, I finally figured that out. So... I guess I really owe you one.": "",
  "Hey, I'm just glad I was able to help.": "",
  "Um. Can I... ask you something?": "",
  "We've been going out several times now, and... I guess what I'm wondering is... what happens after I get a job?": "",
  "Well, the reason we've been meeting up like this is because I needed help.": "",
  "So you're saying we won't have a reason to meet up after you get a job?": "",
  "...Not exactly, but...": "",
  "Would you still be interested in hanging out with me?": "",
  "Of course I would. Getting a job won't change that.": "",
  "Really!? Oh, I'm so glad to hear you say that!": "",
  "Yeah, why wouldn't I?": "",
  "I dunno. Just... promise you'll come see me again?": "",
  "Okay. I promise.": "",
  "(If I say no... that'd be pretty messed up, right?)": "",
  "I wouldn't mind hanging out some more.": "",
  "All right... Sorry if I've caused you any trouble.": "",
  "Nah, it's no trouble at all.": "",
  "Umm... Actually, there's something I have to tell you...": "",
  "Once I get hired, that is.": "",
  "You can't just say it right now?": "",
  "...Er, well...": "",
  "Just wait till I get the job, okay!? I need to focus on my interview!": "",
  "Got it. Sorry.": "",
  "Ryuzenji did seem pretty supportive when you told him about your career.": "",
  "He did, didn't he... I still feel kind of bad, though.": "",
  "I can't believe he fell in love with you because of something you drew so long ago...": "",
  "Yeah, well... I've changed a lot since then.": "",
  "So has he, if you think about it. That picture changed his life.": "",
  "Honestly, my artwork as a kid was nothing special. I'm surprised he even looked at it.": "",
  "Ergh. Maybe so...": "",
  "It's amazing you can draw something so influential.": "",
  "You really do have talent. Even he saw that.": "",
  "...I certainly hope so.": "",
  "Talking things out with you really made all the difference in the world. I'm very grateful for that.": "",
  "Well, time to nail this interview!": "",
  "Thanks to you, I feel like there's nothing I can't do!": "",
  "Ready for that interview now?": "",
  "Mm... I'm still a little nervous...": "",
  "(I guess I couldn't make her feel secure...)": "",
  "Thanks for meeting with me, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Of course. Care to have a seat?": "",
  "N-Nothing... I'm just a little flustered.": "",
  "Oh? Well, make yourself comfortable first.": "",
  "R-Right! I'll do that.": "",
  "So, what's this big important thing you had to tell me?": "",
  "Um, about that...": "",
  "Tsukino-chan?": "",
  "No... I can't. I don't know how to say it.": "",
  "...Gah, this is even worse than taking an interview!": "",
  "(It might help to talk about something else first...)": "",
  "Oh, by the way.": "",
  "Y-Yes?": "",
  "What's this big thing you had to tell me?": "",
  "Oh, about that...": "",
  "Are you all right?": "",
  "Yeah! Now that we talked it all out, I'm ready to share what's on my heart!": "",
  "Did you tell your folks about that new job?": "",
  "And? How'd they take it? Were they mad?": "",
  "Actually... it seems like Ryuzenji-san won them over.": "",
  "Huh!? Ryuzenji did?": "",
  "Yes. He visited my parents and asked them to support me.": "",
  "And when they hesitated to agree, he practically got down on his knees and begged!": "",
  "Wow, he really went that far...": "",
  "Yeah. I guess they couldn't say no to the heir of the Ryuzenji Group.": "",
  "So now they're on my side, at least for the time being.": "",
  "I'm really happy to hear that.": "",
  "Again, congratulations on the job.": "",
  "Thank you. It's all because I talked it over with you.": "",
  "Don't second-guess yourself. You're the one who did all the hard work.": "",
  "Well, I don't want to overestimate myself either. But thanks.": "",
  "It's a year-long contract position, so I'm going in with the mentality that I'm still being tested.": "",
  "You'll be fine. Just focus on doing the best job you can.": "",
  "Yeah! You bet I will!": "",
  "But... I'm still super nervous! Even more than I was at that interview!": "",
  "Don't worry. I'll wait as long as it takes.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I have one\nmore favor to ask.": "",
  "Would it be okay... if I\ncame to see you again?": "",
  "Not about work or anything.\nI just want to be with you.": "",
  "That's... because...": "",
  "The reason I'm applying— I mean, the reason I'm saying this is...": "",
  "Is because I want to keep\ngoing out with you!": "",
  "Well... this is a surprise.": "",
  "Sorry for springing this on you out of nowhere.": "",
  "But I felt like I'd lose my chance if I didn't say something...": "",
  "And I just couldn't let that happen.": "",
  "I'm just following your lead, you know. \"Stop overthinking and just go for it.\" Isn't that your take on things?": "",
  "Why me of all people, though?": "",
  "...At some point, I realized I had feelings for you. But...": "",
  "Unlike me, you're a free spirit... who lives by their own rules.": "",
  "And I really admire that about you.": "",
  "(I guess I need to give her an answer...)": "",
  "Then let's be together.": "",
  "You... You really mean it!?": "",
  "Yeah. I feel the same way about you.": "",
  "And I've been wanting to spend more time together, too. Get to know you deeper.": "",
  "Yagami-san...!": "",
  "(This isn't good... This is considered cheating, right?)": "",
  "Wow. I got myself a dream job <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> a dreamy boyfriend... Is this really happening?": "",
  "Maybe this is all in my head and I'll wake up all of a sudden.": "",
  "If that's the case, then I don't want to wake up either.": "",
  "Yagami-san... You make me so happy, I could cry...": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "What are you trying to say?": "นายพยายามจะพูดอะไร",
  "Are you sure about this?": "แน่ใจเรื่องนี้เหรอ?",
  "Ahahaha...": "ฮ่าฮ่าฮ่า...",
  "For example...": "ยกตัวอย่างเช่น...",
  "Y-Yes?": "ค-ครับ?",
  "Oh, about that...": "อ้อ เรื่องนั้น...",
  "Are you all right?": "เป็นอะไรไหม?"
 }
}
